#: keyboardpageimpl.cpp:208
msgid ""
"<h1>Select Keyboard Type</h1>"
"<p>In this screen you select your keyboard <em>model</em> "
"(in the top window) and the keyboard <em>layout</em> "
"(in the bottom window). The model of the keyboard describes the keyboard "
"hardware. The layout determines things like what character will appear on the "
"screen when you press a key.</p>"
